&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:6pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.0pt;"&gt;宮崎県日南市塚田農場&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;鹿児島県霧島市塚田農場&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;北海道シントク町塚田農場&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;炭火焼鳥塚田農場　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:2.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:6pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;じとっこ組合　など&lt;/p&gt;
