&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:2.2pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;　１株あたり&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:2.2pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;　払込金額&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
